This directory contains local modifications made in 2026. The changes include:

- ROS 2 Humble/aarch64 build and launch integration;
- RoboSense RSFAIRY point-cloud and IMU support plus rs_fairy configuration;
- optional gravity alignment of the mapping world frame;
- independent full-map export, near-field state-estimation registration, and
	near-field PCT source ranges;
- full-frame PCD accumulation, voxel filtering, and transactional dual-PCD map
	saving;
- shutdown/file-handle safety fixes; and
- deployment-specific launch and RViz configuration updates.

